"`TreeViewUpdateMode` is the abstract class of policy objects that implement the various `TreeView` update modes. These what item data (text, icons, etc) that the tree views stores, and what it requests when required. 

## Instance Variables:
  `view`		`TreeView` for which the update mode is providing item update policy."

IconicListUpdateMode subclass: TreeViewUpdateMode [
    addItems: aCollection inHandle: parentHandle afterHandle: siblingHandle [
        	self subclassResponsibility

    ]
    TreeViewUpdateMode class >> icon [
        "Answers an Icon that can be used to represent this class"
        ^TreeView icon
    ]
]
